+## [0.6.0-2022.14] - Local candidate
+
+- Add offline non-GPU counter discovery, statistics and per-frame values in native units.
+- Expose marker categories, native flags and payload metadata from saved captures.
+
 ## [0.6.0-2022.13] - Local candidate

 - Register static or bound instance handlers with `CommandRegistry.RegisterCommand`. Registered commands participate in discovery and can be removed by name or registration handle.
